data: {"type": "CUSTOM", "timestamp": 1793188256666, "name": "modelgen_attempt", "value": {"number": 1, "reason": "The code calculates water volumes from stored energy and temperature differences, derives thermal radii using the Doughty formula, computes conduction-based recovery rates bounded by 0.9, and ensures ", "code": "def ates(heat_stored_mwh, cold_stored_mwh, warm_temp_c, cold_temp_c, aquifer_temp_c, thickness_m):\n    def calc_volume(energy_mwh, temp_diff_c):\n        if energy_mwh <= 0 or temp_diff_c <= 0:\n            return 0.0\n        return energy_mwh * 3.6e+09 / (4.18e+06 * temp_diff_c)\n    \n    def calc_radius(volume_m3, thickness_m):\n        if volume_m3 <= 0 or thickness_m <= 0:\n            return 0.0\n        return math.sqrt(4.18e+06 * volume_m3 / (2.8e+06 * math.pi * thickness_m))\n    \n    def calc_recovery(radius_m, thickness_m):\n        if radius_m <= 0:\n            return 0.0\n        term = 2.0 / thickness_m + 2.0 / radius_m\n        recovery = 1.0 - 3.8 * term\n        return max(0.0, min(0.9, recovery))\n    \n    v_warm = calc_volume(heat_stored_mwh, warm_temp_c - aquifer_temp_c)\n    v_cold = calc_volume(cold_stored_mwh, aquifer_temp_c - cold_temp_c)\n    \n    r_warm = calc_radius(v_warm, thickness_m)\n    r_cold = calc_radius(v_cold, thickness_m)\n    \n    rec_warm = calc_recovery(r_warm, thickness_m)\n    rec_cold = calc_recovery(r_cold, thickness_m)\n    \n    heat_recovered_mwh = rec_warm * heat_stored_mwh\n    heat_loss_mwh = heat_stored_mwh - heat_recovered_mwh\n    heat_recovery = heat_recovered_mwh / heat_stored_mwh if heat_stored_mwh > 0 else 0.0\n    \n    cold_recovered_mwh = rec_cold * cold_stored_mwh\n    cold_loss_mwh = cold_stored_mwh - cold_recovered_mwh\n    cold_recovery = cold_recovered_mwh / cold_stored_mwh if cold_stored_mwh > 0 else 0.0\n    \n    return {\n        \"heat_recovered_mwh\": heat_recovered_mwh,\n        \"heat_loss_mwh\": heat_loss_mwh,\n        \"heat_recovery\": heat_recovery,\n        \"cold_recovered_mwh\": cold_recovered_mwh,\n        \"cold_loss_mwh\": cold_loss_mwh,\n        \"cold_recovery\": cold_recovery,\n        \"warm_radius_m\": r_warm,\n        \"cold_radius_m\": r_cold\n    }\n", "violations": [], "error": "", "case_errors": ["at heat_stored_mwh=0, cold_stored_mwh=4000, warm_temp_c=18, cold_temp_c=7, aquifer_temp_c=12, thickness_m=40: line 10: NameError: name 'math' is not defined", "at heat_stored_mwh=500, cold_stored_mwh=4000, warm_temp_c=18, cold_temp_c=7, aquifer_temp_c=12, thickness_m=40: line 10: NameError: name 'math' is not defined", "at heat_stored_mwh=2000, cold_stored_mwh=4000, warm_temp_c=18, cold_temp_c=7, aquifer_temp_c=12, thickness_m=40: line 10: NameError: name 'math' is not defined", "at heat_stored_mwh=5000, cold_stored_mwh=4000, warm_temp_c=18, cold_temp_c=7, aquifer_temp_c=12, thickness_m=40: line 10: NameError: name 'math' is not defined", "at heat_stored_mwh=1e+04, cold_stored_mwh=4000, warm_temp_c=18, cold_temp_c=7, aquifer_temp_c=12, thickness_m=40: line 10: NameError: name 'math' is not defined", "at heat_stored_mwh=2e+04, cold_stored_mwh=4000, warm_temp_c=18, cold_temp_c=7, aquifer_temp_c=12, thickness_m=40: line 10: NameError: name 'math' is not defined", "at heat_stored_mwh=5000, cold_stored_mwh=4000, warm_temp_c=18, cold_temp_c=7, aquifer_temp_c=12, thickness_m=15: line 10: NameError: name 'math' is not defined", "at heat_stored_mwh=2e+04, cold_stored_mwh=2e+04, warm_temp_c=18, cold_temp_c=7, aquifer_temp_c=12, thickness_m=100: line 10: NameError: name 'math' is not defined", "at heat_stored_mwh=1e+04, cold_stored_mwh=0, warm_temp_c=70, cold_temp_c=7, aquifer_temp_c=12, thickness_m=60: line 10: NameError: name 'math' is not defined", "at heat_stored_mwh=3000, cold_stored_mwh=3000, warm_temp_c=10, cold_temp_c=7, aquifer_temp_c=12, thickness_m=40: line 10: NameError: name 'math' is not defined"], "checks": [], "outputs": [null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null], "sandbox_seconds": 0.039, "